    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but \"resting\" doesnt really change anything. i feel like i've been \"trying\" for years and i just keep ending up in the same dark place. its like some people are just built to survive and others... others are just built to be destroyed. i dont think a therapist can fix something that was never whole to begin with.",
